        "label": "Day Laborer",
        "icon": "day_labor",
        "description": "I can work as a day laborer for [icon=coin]coin. \n\nHauling water, harvesting barley, cleaning stables: whatever work locals will pay a stranger to do.\n\nIf I keep my wages with the employer, they'll steal the money, bit by bit.\n\nStrangers are not well liked in [icon=hommlet]Hommlet.",
